---
/**
 * The Henley Health Club.
 *
 * Slug kept: /the-henley-health-club/ is in the manifest and is the name on the
 * door. The old page opened with "Vibrant, active, healthy and happy" and
 * "state of the art" twice, which tells a 78-year-old weighing up whether they
 * could actually use the place nothing at all. What answers that question is
 * the class list — which is real, and is theirs — and what the machines are.
 *
 * The two gym photographs are from the 2021 opening shoot and have nobody in
 * them, which is the honest choice here as well as the safe one: the old site's
 * only gym picture is a 1200x350 crop of residents mid-class, and a photograph
 * of other people exercising is not what someone wondering if they'd be out of
 * place needs to see.
 */
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import Gallery from '../components/Gallery.astro';
import Questions from '../components/Questions.astro';
import EnquiryBand from '../components/EnquiryBand.astro';
import { PHONE, PHONE_HREF } from '../site.ts';

import gymWide from '../images/gym-wide.jpg';
import gym from '../images/gym.jpg';
import pool from '../images/pool.jpg';
import bowls from '../images/sky-deck-bowls.jpg';

const classes = [
  'Gentle exercise',
  'Balance class',
  'Cardio class',
  'Yoga',
  'Chair yoga and chair meditation',
  'Meditation',
  'Aqua aerobics',
  'Walking group',
];

const questions = [
  {
    q: 'I have not exercised in years. Is it for me?',
    a: 'That is most people who start. The balance and gentle exercise classes exist precisely for someone who has not done this in a while, and nobody is watching you.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Do I pay extra?',
    a: 'The gym, the pool and the group classes are part of living here. A one-to-one session with a trainer is arranged separately.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What if I have a bad hip, or a heart condition?',
    a: 'Tell the trainers and bring whatever your doctor or physiotherapist has said. They will build around it — that is the ordinary case here, not the exception.',
  },
  {
    q: 'When is it open?',
    a: 'The gym and pool are open to residents through the day. Classes run to a timetable that changes with the season; reception has the current one.',
  },
];
---

<Base
  title="The Henley Health Club | The Henley on Broadwater"
  description="A gym, pool and group exercise classes on site at The Henley on Broadwater in Southport — balance, yoga, aqua aerobics and gentle exercise, with trainers who work around what your body does."
>
  <Hero
    image={gymWide}
    alt="The Henley Health Club gym, with cardio equipment along a wall of windows"
    heading="The Henley Health Club"
    standfirst="A gym, a pool and a class timetable downstairs — close enough that the walk there is never the reason you skipped it."
  >
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button" href="#enquire">Book a visit</a>
      <a class="button button--quiet" href={PHONE_HREF}>Call {PHONE}</a>
    </div>
  </Hero>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="lede">
        The hardest part of keeping this up at 75 is getting there. Ours is one lift ride
        away, which removes most of the excuses and all of the weather.
      </p>

      <div class="two-up">
        <div>
          <h2>Classes</h2>
          <ul>{classes.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul>
          <p class="note">
            The timetable changes through the year. Reception has the current one.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2>The gym</h2>
          <p>
            The resistance machines are air-pressure rather than weight stacks: easier on
            joints, and they start lighter and step up in smaller increments than a
            conventional gym allows. There is cardio equipment along the windows.
          </p>
          <p>
            The pool is downstairs for laps or for the aqua aerobics class, and the
            bowling green is on the roof.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Gallery
    photos={[
      { image: gym, alt: 'Resistance machines and free weights in the health club gym', caption: 'The gym' },
      { image: pool, alt: 'The outdoor swimming pool with palm trees and the tower behind', caption: 'The pool, for laps and aqua aerobics' },
      { image: bowls, alt: 'The rooftop bowling green with the Broadwater beyond', caption: 'The Sky Deck bowling green' },
    ]}
  />

  <section class="band band--linen">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>The trainers</h2>
      <p>
        There is no single programme everyone is put on. The trainers will ask what you
        used to do, what hurts, what your doctor has said, and what you actually want to
        be able to keep doing — carry the shopping, get off the floor, last eighteen holes
        — and work back from that.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you would rather just use the machines on your own, that is a perfectly good
        answer too.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Questions questions={questions} heading="Questions about the health club" />

  <EnquiryBand
    interest="apartment"
    heading="Have a look at it"
    invitation="Come and see the gym and the pool while you are here — and if you want to, meet whoever is on that day and ask them the question you are actually worried about."
    formHeading="Book a visit"
  />
</Base>

<style>
  .lede {
    font: var(--type-title-lg);
    color: var(--color-on-surface);
    max-width: 40ch;
    margin-block-end: var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .two-up {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .note {
    font: var(--type-body-md);
    color: var(--color-on-surface-secondary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .two-up {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-xl);
    }
  }
</style>
